<title>USA: Las Vegas CSD 2, N.M., won by Southwest Sec.</title>
<headline>Las Vegas CSD 2, N.M., won by Southwest Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Sec. said it won $1.120 million of Las Vegas City SD 2, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.703 percent.</p>
</text>
